sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Chat service
    participant A as API server
    participant W as Execution engine
    participant G as Model gateway

    U->>C: Question
    C->>A: Run request
    A->>A: Check permission and app, create run record
    A->>W: Enqueue job
    W->>G: Model call
    Note over W,G: No automatic retry on timeout<br/>so a call that already ran is not billed twice
    G-->>W: Response
    W-->>A: Node events (event stream)
    A-->>C: Streaming
    C-->>U: Answer and sources
